  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "The Review Reminder module of eCommerceGo SaaS simplifies the process of gathering valuable feedback from your customers. Once customers receive their orders, this module automatically sends them reminders to leave reviews. With this feature, you can effortlessly collect feedback, improve customer satisfaction, and boost sales.": "eCommerceGo SaaS'ın İnceleme Hatırlatma modülü, müşterilerinizden değerli geri bildirimler toplama sürecini basitleştirir. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Streamlined Feedback Collection": "Kolaylaştırılmış Geri Bildirim Toplama",
  "With the Review Reminder module, collecting customer feedback becomes a seamless process. Customers receive timely reminders to share their thoughts and experiences with your products or services. This ensures that you consistently gather valuable insights, helping you understand customer preferences and areas for improvement.": "İnceleme Hatırlatma modülüyle müşteri geri bildirimlerini toplamak sorunsuz bir süreç haline gelir. ",
  "Customizable Email Templates": "Özelleştirilebilir E-posta Şablonları",
  "Customizing review reminder emails has never been easier. The module allows you to create email templates tailored to your brands voice and style. Whether you want to incentivize customers to leave reviews or simply thank them for their purchase, you have the flexibility to design emails that resonate with your audience.": "İnceleme hatırlatma e-postalarını özelleştirmek hiç bu kadar kolay olmamıştı. ",
  "Manage Review Reminder Settings": "İnceleme Hatırlatıcı Ayarlarını Yönetin",
  "Take control of your review reminder process with flexible settings. You can enable or disable the review reminder button according to your preferences. This feature allows you to adjust your feedback collection strategy based on factors like product launches, seasonal promotions, or inventory changes.": "Esnek ayarlarla inceleme hatırlatma sürecinizin kontrolünü elinize alın. ",
  "Centralized Review Management": "Merkezi İnceleme Yönetimi",
  "All customer reviews are recorded in the Review Reminder module, providing you with a centralized platform to manage feedback. You can easily access and analyze reviews to gain insights into product performance, customer satisfaction, and areas for enhancement. This centralized approach to review management helps you make data-driven decisions to improve your business.": "Tüm müşteri yorumları, İnceleme Hatırlatıcısı modülüne kaydedilir ve size geri bildirimleri yönetmeniz için merkezi bir platform sağlar. ",
